            "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The first Trine game in full 3D </h2> Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power is a platforming game of action, puzzles and adventure, featuring three familiar heroes: Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The heroes try to return their extraordinary gifts to the Artifact called Trine, and so they meddle with powers beyond their understanding: Trine shatters and a heartless ancient sorcerer escapes. With only a broken artifact to guide them, the heroes must try and repair the damage they've caused... or the damage that might yet be done.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A fairytale world of breathtaking sceneries</h2>Face a myriad of physics-based puzzles, wonderful contraptions, dangerous foes and enchanting creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore 7 story-driven Chapters and 11 puzzle-solving, skill-focused Lost Pages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or with friends</h2>Playable in single-player or in co-up with up to three players, both locally or online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the Trine world in a full 3D setting, allowing you to go check out all the nooks and crannies that have been so alluring in the past. <br></li><li> 1–3 players, local and online co-op.<br></li><li> Play as a Wizard, Knight and Thief, switching freely between them.<br></li><li> Eight story levels and ten Lost Page challenge levels.<br></li><li> Amazing fantasy soundtrack by award winning composer Ari Pulkkinen.</li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The first Trine game in full 3D </h2> Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power is a platforming game of action, puzzles and adventure, featuring three familiar heroes: Amadeus the Wizard, Pontius the Knight and Zoya the Thief.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/48eac170834d9b6f23912dca6d7ae4ee.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The heroes try to return their extraordinary gifts to the Artifact called Trine, and so they meddle with powers beyond their understanding: Trine shatters and a heartless ancient sorcerer escapes. With only a broken artifact to guide them, the heroes must try and repair the damage they've caused... or the damage that might yet be done.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > A fairytale world of breathtaking sceneries</h2>Face a myriad of physics-based puzzles, wonderful contraptions, dangerous foes and enchanting creatures.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/c9a6ad6982aea0d9a529386582845837.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore 7 story-driven Chapters and 11 puzzle-solving, skill-focused Lost Pages.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play solo or with friends</h2>Playable in single-player or in co-up with up to three players, both locally or online.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.poster.avif?t=1793622135\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.webm?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/319910/extras/15e896bb7c7b913f972ae44b6dc2f2f6.mp4?t=1793622135\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore the Trine world in a full 3D setting, allowing you to go check out all the nooks and crannies that have been so alluring in the past. <br></li><li> 1–3 players, local and online co-op.<br></li><li> Play as a Wizard, Knight and Thief, switching freely between them.<br></li><li> Eight story levels and ten Lost Page challenge levels.<br></li><li> Amazing fantasy soundtrack by award winning composer Ari Pulkkinen.</li></ul>",
            "short_description": "Trine 3: The Artifacts of Power is a platforming game of action, puzzles and adventure, and the sequel to the award winning Trine and Trine 2. Reunite with the three heroes in an all-new adventure, now for the first time in full 3D!",
